; Horace's cell during the guard AI: L = column, H = row (word)
;
; Scratch word of #R$63DA (ChooseGuardMove), written once per planned guard: Horace's position #R$7C6B converted from a
; screen offset to character-cell coordinates, low byte (+0) the column 0-31, high byte (+1) the row 0-23. Compared with
; the guard's cell #R$6DB0 to decide which directions lead towards him. Not used elsewhere.
;
@label=HoraceCell
g$7C7A DEFW $0000
